---

<section
  class="w-full flex mt-10 md:mt-20 flex-col items-center justify-center bg-gray-100"
  data-tabs
>
  <div
    class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center w-full gap-4 mt-8 max-w-[1500px]"
  >
    <div
      class="flex items-stretch w-full gap-2 sm:gap-4 bg-[#1e1e1e] lg:h-[10vh] rounded-t-2xl"
    >
      <button
        class="flex-1 text-center text-base sm:text-xl md:text-4xl tab-button rounded-t-xl py-2 px-2 md:px-4 font-bold focus:outline-none"
        data-tab="tab1"
        aria-selected="true"
      >
        <p>Caldera</p>
      </button>
      <button
        class="flex-1 text-center tab-button rounded-t-xl py-2 px-2 md:px-4 font-bold text-base sm:text-xl md:text-4xl focus:outline-none"
        data-tab="tab2"
        aria-selected="false"
      >
        <p>Calentamiento directo</p>
      </button>
    </div>
    <div class="py-4 flex justify-center items-center">
      <!-- First Section -->
      <div
        class="w-full flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-3 tab-content text-base md:text-lg text-grisT font-bold"
        data-tab-content="tab1"
      >
        <div class="w-full flex justify-center px-2">
          <img src={t1.src} alt="t1" class="w-full h-auto max-w-[600px]" />
        </div>
        <div class="w-full px-4 md:px-10">
          <p class="text-justify text-sm lg:text-lg md:text-lg font-normal">
            Diseñado para un control preciso de temperatura, la caldera asegura
            una distribución uniforme del calor mediante un eficiente sistema de
            circulación de aceite térmico. Su construcción robusta permite
            operación continua, haciéndolo adecuado para trabajos exigentes que
            requieren desempeño constante y eficiencia energética.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-[#1e1e1e] p-4 sm:p-6 md:p-10 rounded-b-2xl">
          <div
            class="card-row flex sm:grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 overflow-x-auto sm:overflow-visible snap-x snap-mandatory scroll-smooth"
            id="cardRow0"
          >
            <!-- Card 1-A -->
            <div
              class="relative rounded-lg overflow-hidden group cursor-pointer snap-center shrink-0 w-[85%] sm:w-full"
              data-card="0-0"
            >
              <div
                class="w-full h-56 sm:h-64 md:h-72 lg:h-80 bg-black/10 flex items-center justify-center"
              >
                <img src={img1.src} alt="" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
              </div>

              <div
                class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 via-black/20 to-transparent flex flex-col justify-end p-3"
              >
                <span
                  class="font-bold text-white text-sm uppercase tracking-wide leading-tight mb-2"
                >
                  Caldera
                </span>
                <button
                  class="mostrar-mas flex items-center gap-1 text-white/80 text-xs hover:text-white transition-colors"
                  aria-expanded="false"
                >
                  <svg
                    class="chevron w-3 h-3 transition-transform duration-300"
                    viewBox="0 0 12 12"
                    fill="none"
                  >
                    <path
                      d="M2 4l4 4 4-4"
                      stroke="currentColor"
                      stroke-width="1.8"
                      stroke-linecap="round"></path>
                  </svg>
                  mostrar más
                </button>
                <div
                  class="expandible max-h-0 overflow-hidden transition-[max-height] duration-300 ease-out"
                >
                  <p class="text-white/75 text-xs leading-relaxed mt-2">
                    Placeholder
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Card 1-B -->
            <div
              class="relative rounded-lg overflow-hidden group cursor-pointer snap-center shrink-0 w-[85%] sm:w-full"
              data-card="0-1"
            >
              <div
                class="w-full h-56 sm:h-64 md:h-72 lg:h-80 bg-black/10 flex items-center justify-center"
              >
                <img src={img2.src} alt="" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
              </div>
              <div
                class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 via-black/20 to-transparent flex flex-col justify-end p-3"
              >
                <span
                  class="font-bold text-white text-sm uppercase tracking-wide leading-tight mb-2"
                >
                  Serpentines de caldera
                </span>
                <button
                  class="mostrar-mas flex items-center gap-1 text-white/80 text-xs hover:text-white transition-colors"
